Source: zen-browser
Section: web
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ackerman-00
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), chrpath, desktop-file-utils
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/zen-browser/desktop

Package: zen-browser
Architecture: amd64
# Runtime set: dictionaries/hyphenation dirs, system CA certs module
# (libnssckbi is linked from the system libnss3 instead of the bundled
# copy, like the spec), plus the payload's ELF DT_NEEDED union (readelf
# over every shipped ELF; bundled Firefox-private libs excluded). The RPM
# spec lists only 3 manual Requires because RPM auto-deps fill the rest;
# a .deb has no auto-deps, so the full loader-mandatory set is listed.
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, hicolor-icon-theme, libasound2t64, libatk1.0-0t64, libcairo2, libcairo-gobject2, libdbus-1-3, libfontconfig1, libfreetype6, libgdk-pixbuf-2.0-0, libglib2.0-0t64, libgtk-3-0t64, libhunspell-1.7-0, libhyphen0, libnss3, libpango-1.0-0, libpangocairo-1.0-0, libstdc++6, libx11-6, libx11-xcb1, libxcb-shm0, libxcb1, libxcomposite1, libxcursor1, libxdamage1, libxext6, libxfixes3, libxi6, libxrandr2, libxrender1
Description: Minimal browser focused on privacy and calm browsing
 Zen Browser is a free, open-source web browser based on Mozilla Firefox.
